From 4709e32b34d229e0805d679b6fb916bf4161af96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas <thomas.wang@ponyft.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 00:28:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Hybrid AOT prototype: SHUnit ring dispatch in RN
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ReactInstance.cpp: additive evaluateSHUnit path — weak-linked registry
  SHUnits (sh_export_core/util) evaluated BEFORE normal bundle evaluation
  (upstream hook is either/or); weak_import on Apple; __hybridLog jsi host
  function as a release-safe log channel (RCTLog is compiled out in release).
- ReactAndroid jni/CMakeLists.txt: link registry .o files +
  hermes-engine::hermesvm into libreactnative (arm64, EXISTS-guarded).
- rn-tester: hybrid-serializer.js Metro plugin (stable path-hash module IDs,
  sha256 content hashes, __d dispatch wrapper, hybrid-manifest.json emission)
  wired into metro.config.js; HybridAOTDemo + hybrid/ modules (HybridReactCore
  twin = real react-reconciler 18.3.1 bundled as a Metro module, HybridUtil
  ring-1 demo module).

Built with REACT_NATIVE_OVERRIDE_HERMES_DIR + react.internal.useHermesNightly=false
(Android) and RCT_BUILD_HERMES_FROM_SOURCE=true (iOS). Registry objects come
from bench/hybrid/build-rn-registry.py in the AOT-RN workspace.


